WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.799
we really need a president who is not the
laughing stock of the world and once again,

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:08.250
leaders have been caught on video laughing
at Donald Trump this time.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:13.540
It's Russian president Vladimir Putin and
Syrian dictator Bashar Al Assad.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.360
Remember that it was Donald Trump who said,
we need a non laughingstock president.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.900
He tweeted back in 2014 when Barack Obama
was president.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.390
We need a president who isn't the laughing
stock to the entire world.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.880
We need a truly great leader, a genius at
strategy and winning respect.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.339
He claimed he would be that president.

00:00:31.339 --> 00:00:34.680
Here's video of Putin and Assad laughing at
Trump.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.440
Now, of course, they're not speaking in English.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:40.040
It's Russian with Putin using the aid of a
translator.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.829
So I'll summarize what was said per Axios.

00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:47.649
The video shows the leaders talking to each
other while visiting the Orthodox church of

00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:50.090
the Virgin Mary in Damascus.

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:56.010
Assad tells Putin about the apostle Paul,
who became Christian at the gate of Damascus

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:01.060
and he jokingly says, if Trump arrives along
this road, everything will be normal with

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.579
him to Putin.

00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:05.120
Then laughs and tells a sod, it will be repaired.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.120
Invite him.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.510
He will come and Assad answers.

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:10.150
He's ready to invite Trump to which Putin
responds, smiling.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:15.270
I will tell him, and they all laugh and what
you have to understand is the literal translation

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.230
doesn't really do it justice.

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:20.830
Let's look at the video where they are just
laughing and having a grand old time laughing

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:21.830
at Trump.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:23.500
Then I'll explain the sort of gist of this

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:33.750
[inaudible]

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:45.130
this is happening all the time.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:49.180
World leaders laughing at Trump, so the literal
translation doesn't make the joke totally

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:54.100
obvious, but it would sort of be like saying,
you know, you should invite Trump to visit

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.720
the road to Damascus.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:02.060
If walking that road led Paul to see the light,
maybe it would fix Donald Trump as well.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.560
The idea being that Trump is clueless.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.570
That's the gist of it.

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:10.570
Remember that a few months ago, Donald Trump
left the NATO summit early after world leaders,

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:15.730
including the Canadian prime minister, Justin
Trudeau, French president Emmanuel McCrone

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.370
and British prime minister Boris Johnson were
caught on video laughing at Trump.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.500
Here's that video.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:44.700
As

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:51.750
a reminder, Trump so triggered by that one
that he left the NATO summit early, and then

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:56.530
of course there was the time that the entire
room full of the United nations national assembly

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:03.690
laughed at Donald Trump's ridiculous hyperbole
in 2018 a particularly orange looking Trump

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:06.480
getting a laugh, but he wasn't telling any
jokes.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:13.460
Today I stand before the United nations general
assembly to share the extraordinary progress

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:18.040
we've made in less than two years.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:24.900
My administration has accomplished more than
almost any administration in the history of

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:27.310
our country.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:35.010
America is so true.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:38.790
Didn't expect that reaction, but that's

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:39.790
okay.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:40.790
Weren't

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:44.990
we supposed to be getting away from the laughing
stock president by electing Donald Trump?

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.180
It's the opposite.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.459
It's the same projection.

00:03:47.459 --> 00:03:52.870
It's all the stuff Trump said Obama was doing
or represented or was.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.490
Trump actually is all the things that Trump
said Hillary would do if she were to become

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:58.630
president.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:03.160
Trump is actually doing wild, trying to take
credit for things that he actually had nothing

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.160
to do with.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.190
I'm sick of having a laughingstock president.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:07.790
I want to fix this.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:08.790
Let's fix it.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.040
In November,

